<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">K'inich Tatbu Skull IV</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">fl. c. 808</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">K'inich Tatbu Skull IV was the last known king of the Maya city of Yaxchilan, recorded on Lintel 10 around 808. That inscription records his capture of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kinich-yat-ahk-ii">K'inich Yat Ahk II</a>, the last known king of the rival city of Piedras Negras. Yaxchilan was abandoned soon after his reign as the Classic Maya kingdoms collapsed.</p></div>
